commit fb3e8fd160bf6df3139ad44c972e936f8a23a89a
Author: largo <largo@lukezautke.com>
Date:   Fri Feb 13 15:47:02 2026 -0700

    feat: document kind system with mermaid detection, tab menus, and state persistence
    
    - MarkdownDocumentKind union type ('markdown' | 'mermaid') for document classification
    - isMermaidText() content detection heuristic with 14 diagram type starters
    - RenderPane dispatches renderer by kind (MermaidDiagram vs MarkdownRenderer)
    - Tab icons reflect document kind (GitBranch for mermaid)
    - NewTabMenuItems dropdown: New Markdown, New Mermaid, Duplicate, Import
    - Paste/drop/file-import auto-detection of mermaid content
    - localStorage persistence via loadState/saveState for documents, activeDocId, isExpanded
    - LaTeX paste conversion (inline and block)
    - MermaidDiagram minor rendering improvements

